<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.7.5">
<l>uḻuvatōr paṭaiyu mulakkaiyum villu moṇcuṭa rāḻiyuñ caṅkum</l>
<l>maḻuvoṭu vāḷum paṭaikkala muṭaiya mālpuru ṭōttamaṉ vāḻ</l>
<l>veḻumai yuṅkūṭi yīṇṭiya pāva miṟaippoḻu taḷaviṉi lellāṅ</l>
<l>kaḻuviṭum perumaik kaṅkaiyiṉ karaimēl kaṇṭameṉ ṉuṅkaṭi nakarē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The dwelling place of Māl Puruṣottama,</l>
<l rend="indent">armed with [an array of] weapons –</l>
<l rend="indent">a sword, along with an axe,</l>
<l rend="indent">a tool for ploughing, the pestle, bow,</l>
<l rend="indent">bright flaming discus, and conch,</l>
<l>is the protected city called Kaṇṭam</l>
<l rend="indent">on the banks of the great Ganges</l>
<l>where all the sins collected and clustered over seven births</l>
<l rend="indent">are removed in an instant.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
